WEBVTT

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:31.602
"Usiku tutaenda kutengeneza mtoto."

00:00:31.772 --> 00:00:37.108
Maongezi yangu yatahusu athari ya dini

00:00:37.108 --> 00:00:41.277
kwa idadi ya watoto kwa mwanamke.

00:00:41.277 --> 00:00:42.942
Hii ni muhimu kweli,

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:44.472
kwa sababu kila mtu anaelewa

00:00:44.472 --> 00:00:46.754
kua kuna aina fulani ya mpaka

00:00:46.754 --> 00:00:49.982
kwa jinsi watu wengi wanaweza kua kwenye
hii sayari.

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:51.929
Na kuna baadhi ya watu

00:00:51.929 --> 00:00:55.348
wanaosema kua idadi ya watu duniani imekua
kama hivi --

00:00:55.348 --> 00:00:57.155
bilioni tatu mwaka 1960,

00:00:57.155 --> 00:00:59.794
bilioni saba mwaka jana tu --

00:00:59.794 --> 00:01:01.340
na itaendelea kukua